OL,3,ASchoolboy imposter subjected
OL,4,Aex-professor and wife to 'terrifying
OL,5,Aordeal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMy Old School chronicled MacKinnon's
OL,8,Freturn to Bearsden Academy, as Brandon
OL,9,FLee, a 16-year-old who had supposedly
OL,10,Fjust moved to Scotland from Canada.
OL,12,FMacKinnon hatched the plan so he could
OL,13,Fpursue his dream of becoming a doctor
OL,14,Fhaving been thrown out of Glasgow
OL,15,FUniversity, when Prof Whiting was dean
OL,16,Fof the medical school.
